{"build":"49908b2@26/11/2026, 08:56:03","data":{"book":{"title":"Kirtan Guide","title_full_short":"Kīrtan Guide 12th Ed","subtitle":"London, Twelfth Edition, 2026","slug":"en","sort_order":1,"shortcuts":[{"icon":"clock","title":"The Daily Programme","slug":"003-programme"}],"audio":{"filter":{"by_title":["Srila B.S. Govinda Dev-Goswami Maharaj","Srila B.R. Sridhar Dev-Goswami Maharaj","Nabadwip temple","Kamal Krishna Prabhu","Manasa Krishna Prabhu"]}},"songsCount":194},"descriptions":[{"title":"Kirtan Guide","title_full_short":"Kīrtan Guide 12th Ed","subtitle":"London, Twelfth Edition, 2026","slug":"en","sort_order":1,"shortcuts":[{"icon":"clock","title":"The Daily Programme","slug":"003-programme"}],"audio":{"filter":{"by_title":["Srila B.S. Govinda Dev-Goswami Maharaj","Srila B.R. Sridhar Dev-Goswami Maharaj","Nabadwip temple","Kamal Krishna Prabhu","Manasa Krishna Prabhu"]}},"songsCount":194},{"title":"Гаудия Гитанджали","subtitle":"Cборник вайшнавских песен и молитв","slug":"ru","sort_order":2,"render":{"tg.contents.first_line":false,"tg.a-z.title.words":3},"songsCount":178},{"title":"Guía de Kīrtan","subtitle":"Edición Detallada. Con traducción palabra por palabra y explicación de estilo","slug":"es","sort_order":3,"songsCount":146},{"title":"Ґаудія Ґітанджалі","subtitle":"Вайшнавський пісенник українскою мовою","slug":"ua","sort_order":6,"language":"uk","render":{"tg.contents.first_line":false,"tg.a-z.title.words":4},"songsCount":74},{"title":"Kirtan Guide","subtitle":"Chiang Mai English Edition, 2022","slug":"en-2022","sort_order":7,"hidden":false,"is_legacy":{"show_micro_thumbnail_on_main":true},"songsCount":166}],"nav":{"171":{"prev":{"path":"/en/ki-jani-ki-bale-tomara-dhamete/","title":"Goptṛtve Varaṇa"},"next":{"path":"/en/hari-he-prapanche-podiya-agati-hoiya/","title":"Bhajan-lālasā"}}},"song":{"meta":{"page":171,"author":"Śrīla Bhakti Vinod Ṭhākur","first_line":"bhuliyā tomāre saṁsāre āsiyā"},"title":["Dainya"],"author":["by Śrīla Bhakti Vinod Ṭhākur"],"verses":[{"number":"1","text":["bhuliyā tomāre    saṁsāre āsiyā","    peye nānā-vidha vyathā","tomāra charaṇe    āsiyāchhi āmi","    baliba duḥkhera kathā"],"translation":["O Lord, forgetting you and coming to this material world, I have experienced various pains and sorrows. Now I am approaching your lotus feet to submit my tale of woe."],"isLong":false},{"number":"2","text":["jananī-jaṭhare    chhilāma yakhana","    viṣama bandhana-pāśe","eka-bāra prabhu!    dekhā diyā more","    vañchile e dīna dāse"],"translation":["While I was bound up tightly in the unbearable confines of my mother’s womb, O Lord, You once revealed Yourself before me, but briefly, and then abandoned this poor servant of Yours."],"isLong":false},{"number":"3","text":["takhana bhāvinu    janama pāiyā","    kariba bhajana tava","janama ha-ila    paḍi’ māyā-jāle","    nā ha-ila jñāna-lava"],"translation":["At that moment, I promised that having taken birth I would worship you. But after taking birth, I fell into the entangling network of worldly illusion, devoid of even a drop of true knowledge."],"isLong":false},{"number":"4","text":["ādarera chhele    svajanera kole","    hāsiyā kāṭānu kāla","janaka-jananī-    snehete bhuliyā","    saṁsāra lāgila bhāla"],"translation":["As a boy cradled in the lap of relatives, I passed my time smiling and laughing. My parents’ affection helped me to forget You still more, my Lord, and I began to think the material world to be a very nice place."],"isLong":false},{"number":"5","text":["krame dina dina    bālaka ha-iyā","    khelinu bālaka saha","āra kichhu-dine    jñāna upajila","    pāṭha paḍi ahar-ahaḥ"],"translation":["Day by day I grew and soon began playing with other boys. My powers of understanding emerged and I read and studied my school lessons incessantly."],"isLong":false},{"number":"6","text":["vidyāra gaurave    bhrami’ deśe deśe","    dhana upārjana kari’","svajana-pālana    kari eka-mane","    bhulinu tomāre hari!"],"translation":["Travelling from place to place, proud of my education, I grew wealthy and maintained my family with undivided attention. O Lord Hari, I forgot You!"],"isLong":false},{"number":"7","text":["vārddhakye ekhana    bhakati-vinoda","    kā̐diyā kātara ati","nā bhajiyā tore    dina vṛthā gela","    ekhana ki ha’be gati?"],"translation":["Now in old age, this Bhakti Vinod very sadly weeps. I failed to worship You, O Lord, and instead passed my life in vain. What will be my fate now?"],"isLong":false}],"resources":{"audio":[{"title":"Srila B.S. Govinda Dev-Goswami Maharaj","embed_url":"https://soundcloud.com/kostya-netrebenko/18-bhuliya-tomare-samsara-asiya-8","personSlug":"srila-b-s-govinda-dev-goswami-maharaj"},{"title":"Kamal Krishna Prabhu","embed_url":"https://soundcloud.com/jayasri-sound/02-bhuliya-tomare-samsare","personSlug":"kamal-krishna-prabhu"},{"title":"Manasa Krishna Prabhu","embed_url":"https://soundcloud.com/huron/bhuliya-tomare","personSlug":"manasa-krishna-prabhu"}]},"hasWbw":false,"hasVersesText":true,"hasVersesTranslations":true,"hasLongVerses":false,"fullInlineWbw":false},"telegraphUrl":"https://telegra.ph/Dainya-02-22"},"head":{"canonical":"/en/bhuliya-tomare-samsare-asiya/","description":"Dainya — a Vaiṣṇava song by Śrīla Bhakti Vinod Ṭhākur with lyrics, English translation and word-by-word meaning. From Kirtan Guide.","title":"Dainya. by Śrīla Bhakti Vinod Ṭhākur | Kirtan Site"},"kind":"song","route":{"kind":"item","bookId":"en","slug":"bhuliya-tomare-samsare-asiya"}}